<p>Decimal 36875. Raw name for this VIC chip register. Also known as <strong>SOUND2_REGISTER</strong>, where the full description lives.</p>
<p>Sound oscillator 2, the alto voice, one octave above oscillator 1.</p>
<ul>
<li>Bit 7 - switches the voice on or off</li>
<li>Bits 6-0 - pitch, higher values give higher notes</li>
</ul>
<p>The NOTE_ constants already have bit 7 set.</p>
